      ],
      "text": "A cornugon's tail Strike deals 4d6 bleed.\n\nThe DC of the flat check to stop the bleeding starts at DC 20 Flat check and is reduced to DC 15 Flat check only if someone successfully assists. The DC to Administer First Aid to a creature with an infernal wound increases by 10.\n\nA spellcaster or item using healing magic on an infernally wounded creature must succeed at a DC 34 counteract check or the magic fails to heal the creature.\n\nEffect: Infernal Wound",
